    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 补上升级流程里的序列同步缺口",
      "summary": "用 pg_createsubscriber 做在线升级时，表数据靠逻辑复制同步，序列取值却还是旧的，切换后很容易撞上重复键错误。PostgreSQL 19 把序列同步做进核心：序列可随表一起发布，由专门的同步 worker 把发布端状态复制到订阅端。发布时写 FOR ALL SEQUENCES, ALL TABLES，切换前再对订阅执行 REFRESH SEQUENCES。目前仍要显式加入发布并手动刷新。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.fastware.com/blog/closing-a-critical-gap-in-postgresql-upgrade-workflows-with-sequence-synchronization",
      "author": "Vigneshwaran C",
      "source": "Fujitsu Enterprise Postgres",
      "source_date": "2026-06-30",
      "image": "https://www.postgresql.fastware.com/hubfs/Images/Featured/Blog/img-featured-blog-closing-a-critical-gap-in-postgresql.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "逻辑复制",
        "序列",
        "升级"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "SQL 标准新接受 QUALIFY 等四项提案",
      "summary": "Peter Eisentraut 报告了 6 月的斯德哥尔摩 SQL 与 GQL 标准会议。工作草案新接受四项提案：QUALIFY 在窗口函数之后过滤，INSERT BY NAME 按列名匹配，SELECT 列表的 EXCLUDE 去掉指定列，JOIN TO ONE 在运行时校验连接基数。PostgreSQL 这边 QUALIFY 在 19 周期暂停，预计 20 继续，EXCLUDE 已有部分实现。新标准计划 2027 年年中发布。",
      "url": "https://peter.eisentraut.org/blog/2026/06/30/waiting-for-sql-202y-stockholm-meeting-report",
      "author": "Peter Eisentraut",
      "source": "peter.eisentraut.org",
      "source_date": "2026-06-30",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "SQL 标准",
        "QUALIFY"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "表太多会把内存和升级都拖垮",
      "summary": "Laurenz Albe 说明了表太多的代价：一个后端访问过两万张表之后，relcache 与 catcache 从 4.1 MB 涨到 221 MB，pg_attribute 里堆了 94 万行。连带问题包括 autovacuum worker 起不来、pg_upgrade 从几分钟变成几天。这些缓存只增不减，他建议从设计上减少表数量，用规模适中的连接池，并在 v14 以上用 idle_session_timeout 清掉空闲会话。",
      "url": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/too-many-tables-are-bad/",
      "author": "Laurenz Albe",
      "source": "Cybertec 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-30",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "内存",
        "系统表",
        "升级"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "用原生特性把 PostgreSQL 当时态数据库使",
      "summary": "Gulçin Yildirim 演示了用原生特性表达时态语义。PostgreSQL 18 起可以用 WITHOUT OVERLAPS 写出核心规则：同一业务键的有效期不能重叠，形如 PRIMARY KEY (id, valid_at WITHOUT OVERLAPS)，重叠的会被直接拒绝。配合范围类型、带 PERIOD 的时态外键和 btree_gist，应用时间这一侧已经相当完整。系统时间的自动版本化和时间旅行查询还得靠触发器或扩展。",
      "url": "https://xata.io/blog/postgres-as-a-temporal-db",
      "author": "Gulçin Yildirim",
      "source": "Xata 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-30",
      "image": "https://xata.io/api/og?title=PostgreSQL+as+a+temporal+database&amp%3Bauthor=G%C3%BCl%C3%A7in+Y%C4%B1ld%C4%B1r%C4%B1m+Jel%C3%ADnek",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "时态数据",
        "约束",
        "范围类型"
      ],
      "position": 4
